[{:db/id 17592186119936 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-e59ecbbf-3ac2-51fb-8da8-83763d787a9a"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-e59ecbbf-3ac2-51fb-8da8-83763d787a9a" :question/id #uuid "e59ecbbf-3ac2-51fb-8da8-83763d787a9a" :question/math-academy-id "q-71033" :question/problem "Find a parametric equation of the plane that passes through the points $D(1,0,-2),\\,E(-2,-2,5)$, and $F(-2,4,3).$" :question/worked-solution "First, we need to find two vectors that are parallel to the plane (but not to each other). Let's use the displacement vectors $\\overset{\\to }{DE}$ and $\\overset{\\to }{DF},$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{DE} & =⟨-2,-2,5⟩-⟨1,0,-2⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-3,-2,7⟩ \\\\ \\overset{\\to }{DF} & =⟨-2,4,3⟩-⟨1,0,-2⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-3,4,5⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, if we consider the position vector $d=⟨1,0,-2⟩$ of the point $D,$ then the corresponding parametric equation of the plane is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r & =d+s\\overset{\\to }{DE}+t\\overset{\\to }{DF} \\\\ r & =⟨1,0,-2⟩+s⟨-3,-2,7⟩+t⟨-3,4,5⟩,\\,s,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-918bca49-2085-5b3c-9bbd-1ed60948277f"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-918bca49-2085-5b3c-9bbd-1ed60948277f" :answer-field/id #uuid "918bca49-2085-5b3c-9bbd-1ed60948277f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-42182090-ca90-5aff-919b-f97f28d17f45" :answer-field/choices ["answer-36f17219-1319-57b9-b736-3daca3fe9f64" "answer-076c0841-49e0-5efa-932b-cea12451f354" "answer-dd4f3967-0094-5670-b34b-c4d617495978" "answer-42182090-ca90-5aff-919b-f97f28d17f45" "answer-a639639c-9709-5ea4-b9d7-eed8e4f97ee2"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-36f17219-1319-57b9-b736-3daca3fe9f64" :answer/id #uuid "36f17219-1319-57b9-b736-3daca3fe9f64" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "r=⟨1,0,-2⟩+s⟨-2,-2,5⟩+t⟨-2,4,3⟩,\\,s,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-076c0841-49e0-5efa-932b-cea12451f354" :answer/id #uuid "076c0841-49e0-5efa-932b-cea12451f354" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "r=⟨1,0,-2⟩+s⟨-2,-2,5⟩+t⟨-3,4,5⟩,\\,s,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-dd4f3967-0094-5670-b34b-c4d617495978" :answer/id #uuid "dd4f3967-0094-5670-b34b-c4d617495978" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "r=⟨1,0,-2⟩+s⟨-2,4,3⟩+t⟨-3,4,5⟩,\\,s,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-42182090-ca90-5aff-919b-f97f28d17f45" :answer/id #uuid "42182090-ca90-5aff-919b-f97f28d17f45" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "r=⟨1,0,-2⟩+s⟨-3,-2,7⟩+t⟨-3,4,5⟩,\\,s,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a639639c-9709-5ea4-b9d7-eed8e4f97ee2" :answer/id #uuid "a639639c-9709-5ea4-b9d7-eed8e4f97ee2" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "The plane is undefined" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "activity-f1f3e620-4475-5a3a-a265-6ab29906aca2" :activity/id #uuid "f1f3e620-4475-5a3a-a265-6ab29906aca2" :activity/title "The Parametric Equations of a Plane" :activity/type :activity.type/review :activity/scope 17592186050308 :activity/course 17592186046659 :activity/steps ["step-b87c320e-e438-5e5e-b4bc-c722b9da8264" "step-6962e54d-afff-5346-b8ad-2f0747169762" "step-80c6a6f7-a534-55d9-a6a9-83c73859670a" "step-87cee5fb-f33c-5202-a9b9-1f5b449bede4" "step-a96d0f38-f22e-54d6-9800-3b945209e167"] :activity/first-step "step-b87c320e-e438-5e5e-b4bc-c722b9da8264" :db/ensure [:activity/validate]} {:db/id "step-b87c320e-e438-5e5e-b4bc-c722b9da8264" :step/id #uuid "b87c320e-e438-5e5e-b4bc-c722b9da8264" :step/content 17592186391682 :step/next "step-6962e54d-afff-5346-b8ad-2f0747169762" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-6962e54d-afff-5346-b8ad-2f0747169762" :step/id #uuid "6962e54d-afff-5346-b8ad-2f0747169762" :step/content 17592186